  "termsIntroTitle": "1. Introduction",
  "termsIntroContent": "Welcome to our E-Commerce platform. These Terms and Conditions govern your use of our mobile application and services. By accessing or using our app, you agree to be bound by these terms. If you disagree with any part of these terms, you may not access our service.",
  "termsAccountTitle": "2. Account Registration",
  "termsAccountContent": "To use certain features of our service, you must register for an account. You agree to:\n\n• Provide accurate and complete information\n• Maintain the security of your password\n• Notify us immediately of any unauthorized use\n• Accept responsibility for all activities under your account",
  "termsUserRespTitle": "3. User Responsibilities",
  "termsUserRespContent": "As a user of our platform, you agree to:\n\n• Use the service only for lawful purposes\n• Not violate any applicable laws or regulations\n• Not infringe on intellectual property rights\n• Not transmit harmful or malicious code\n• Not attempt to gain unauthorized access to our systems",
  "termsProductsTitle": "4. Products and Services",
  "termsProductsContent": "We strive to provide accurate product descriptions and pricing. However:\n\n• Product images are for illustration purposes\n• We reserve the right to modify prices without notice\n• Product availability may vary\n• We are not liable for pricing or description errors",
  "termsOrdersTitle": "5. Orders and Payment",
  "termsOrdersContent": "When placing an order, you agree that:\n\n• All information provided is accurate\n• You are authorized to use the payment method\n• You will pay all applicable charges\n• Orders are subject to acceptance and availability\n• We may cancel orders for any reason",
  "termsShippingTitle": "6. Shipping and Delivery",
  "termsShippingContent": "For shipping and delivery:\n\n• Delivery times are estimates only\n• We are not responsible for delays beyond our control\n• Risk of loss passes to you upon delivery\n• You must inspect items upon delivery\n• Delivery address must be accurate and complete",
  "termsReturnsTitle": "7. Returns and Refunds",
  "termsReturnsContent": "Our return and refund policy includes:\n\n• Items must be returned within the specified period\n• Products must be in original condition\n• Proof of purchase is required\n• Refunds will be processed to the original payment method\n• Some items may not be eligible for return",
  "termsIpTitle": "8. Intellectual Property",
  "termsIpContent": "All content on our platform, including but not limited to text, graphics, logos, images, and software, is our property or that of our licensors and is protected by copyright, trademark, and other intellectual property laws.",
  "termsPrivacyTitle": "9. Privacy and Data Protection",
  "termsPrivacyContent": "Your privacy is important to us. We collect and use your personal information in accordance with our Privacy Policy. By using our service, you consent to our collection and use of your information as described.",
  "termsLiabilityTitle": "10. Limitation of Liability",
  "termsLiabilityContent": "To the maximum extent permitted by law:\n\n• We are not liable for indirect or consequential damages\n• Our total liability is limited to the amount paid by you\n• We do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free service\n• We are not responsible for third-party content or services",
  "termsIndemnifyTitle": "11. Indemnification",
  "termsIndemnifyContent": "You agree to indemnify and hold us harmless from any claims, damages, losses, liabilities, and expenses arising from your use of our service or violation of these terms.",
  "termsModTitle": "12. Modifications to Terms",
  "termsModContent": "We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. We will notify you of significant changes. Your continued use of the service after changes constitutes acceptance of the modified terms.",
  "termsTerminationTitle": "13. Termination",
  "termsTerminationContent": "We may terminate or suspend your account and access to our service immediately, without prior notice, for any reason, including breach of these terms.",
  "termsLawTitle": "14. Governing Law",
  "termsLawContent": "These terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.",
  "termsContactTitle": "15. Contact Information",
  "termsContactContent": "If you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, please contact us:\n\nEmail: support@taksh-ecommerce.com\nPhone: +91 1800-123-4567\nAddress: Mumbai, Maharashtra, India",
  "termsAck": "By using our service, you acknowledge that you have read and understood these Terms & Conditions.",
  "refundCommitmentTitle": "Our Commitment",
  "refundCommitmentContent": "At Taksh E-Commerce, customer satisfaction is our top priority. We want you to be completely satisfied with your purchase. If you're not happy with your order, we're here to help with our easy return and refund process.",
  "refundReadPolicy": "Please read this policy carefully to understand your rights and responsibilities regarding returns and refunds.",
  "refundEligibilityTitle": "1. Return Eligibility",
  "refundEligibilityContent": "You can return most items within 7 days of delivery if:",
  "refundEligibilityItem1": "The item is unused and in its original condition",
  "refundEligibilityItem2": "All original packaging, tags, and labels are intact",
  "refundEligibilityItem3": "You have proof of purchase (order confirmation or invoice)",
  "refundEligibilityItem4": "The product is not on the non-returnable list",
  "refundEligibilityItem5": "The item has not been damaged or altered",
  "refundNonReturnableTitle": "2. Non-Returnable Items",
  "refundNonReturnableContent": "The following items cannot be returned:",
  "refundNonReturnableItem1": "Perishable goods (food, flowers, etc.)",
  "refundNonReturnableItem2": "Intimate or sanitary products",
  "refundNonReturnableItem3": "Customized or personalized items",
  "refundNonReturnableItem4": "Digital products and downloads",
  "refundNonReturnableItem5": "Gift cards and vouchers",
  "refundNonReturnableItem6": "Products marked as \"non-returnable\" at the time of purchase",
  "refundProcessTitle": "3. Return Process",
  "refundProcessContent": "Follow these simple steps to initiate a return:",
  "refundStep1Title": "Initiate Return Request",
  "refundStep1Desc": "Go to \"Your Orders\" section in the app and select the item you want to return. Choose the return reason and submit your request.",
  "refundStep2Title": "Return Approval",
  "refundStep2Desc": "Our team will review your request within 24 hours. You'll receive a confirmation email with return instructions.",
  "refundStep3Title": "Pack the Item",
  "refundStep3Desc": "Pack the item securely in its original packaging with all accessories, tags, and invoice.",
  "refundStep4Title": "Pickup or Drop-off",
  "refundStep4Desc": "Choose between free pickup from your address or drop-off at our partner locations.",
  "refundTimelineTitle": "4. Refund Timeline",
  "refundTimelineContent": "After we receive your returned item:",
  "refundTimelineItem1Day": "Day 1-2",
  "refundTimelineItem1Desc": "Item received at our facility and quality check initiated",
  "refundTimelineItem2Day": "Day 3-4",
  "refundTimelineItem2Desc": "Quality inspection completed and refund approved",
  "refundTimelineItem3Day": "Day 5-7",
  "refundTimelineItem3Desc": "Refund processed to your original payment method",
  "refundProcessingNote": "Bank processing may take an additional 3-5 business days depending on your bank.",
  "refundMethodsTitle": "5. Refund Methods",
  "refundMethodsContent": "Refunds will be processed through:",
  "refundMethodOriginalTitle": "Original Payment Method",
  "refundMethodOriginalDesc": "Refunded to the same card/UPI/wallet used for purchase",
  "refundMethodOriginalDays": "5-7 days",
  "refundMethodCreditTitle": "Store Credit",
  "refundMethodCreditDesc": "Instant credit to your Taksh E-Commerce wallet for future purchases",
  "refundMethodCreditDays": "Instant",
  "refundMethodBankTitle": "Bank Transfer",
  "refundMethodBankDesc": "Direct transfer to your bank account (requires account details)",
  "refundMethodBankDays": "7-10 days",
  "refundDamagedTitle": "6. Damaged or Defective Products",
  "refundDamagedContent": "If you receive a damaged or defective product:\n\n• Report within 48 hours of delivery\n• Provide clear photos of the damage/defect\n• We will arrange immediate pickup\n• Replacement or full refund will be processed\n• No questions asked for genuine cases",
  "refundWrongTitle": "7. Wrong Product Delivered",
  "refundWrongContent": "If you receive the wrong product:\n\n• Contact us immediately through the app\n• We will arrange free return pickup\n• Correct product will be shipped immediately\n• If correct product is unavailable, full refund will be issued",
  "refundPartialTitle": "8. Partial Refunds",
  "refundPartialContent": "In certain situations, partial refunds may be granted:",
  "refundPartialItem1": "Items returned after the return window but within 15 days",
  "refundPartialItem2": "Products with signs of use or minor damage",
  "refundPartialItem3": "Items missing accessories or packaging",
  "refundPartialItem4": "Discounted or sale items (as per terms)",
  "refundExchangeTitle": "9. Exchange Policy",
  "refundExchangeContent": "We offer easy exchanges for:\n\n• Size or color variations\n• Different product models\n• Upgraded versions\n\nThe exchange process is similar to returns, but you can select a replacement product during the return request.",
  "refundCancelTitle": "10. Cancellation Policy",
  "refundCancelContent": "You can cancel your order before it is shipped:\n\n• Full refund for pre-shipment cancellations\n• Instant processing to original payment method\n• No cancellation charges\n• Refund within 3-5 business days",
  "refundContactTitle": "11. Contact for Returns",
  "refundContactContent": "Need help with returns or refunds? Reach out to us:\n\nEmail: returns@taksh-ecommerce.com\nLive Chat: Available 24/7 in the app\n\nOur customer support team is here to assist you throughout the return and refund process.",
  "refundSatisfactionTitle": "100% Satisfaction Guarantee",
  "refundSatisfactionContent": "We stand behind our products and are committed to your satisfaction.",
  "privacyIntroTitle": "Introduction",
  "privacyIntroContent": "At Taksh E-Commerce, we are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring the security of your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our mobile application and services.",
  "privacyAgreeContent": "By using our app, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.",
  "privacyCollectTitle": "1. Information We Collect",
  "privacyCollectContent": "We collect several types of information for various purposes:",
  "privacyPersonalTitle": "Personal Information",
  "privacyPersonalContent": "• Name, email address, and phone number\n• Shipping and billing addresses\n• Payment information (securely processed)\n• Date of birth (optional)\n• Profile picture (optional)",
  "privacyUsageTitle": "Usage Data",
  "privacyUsageContent": "• App usage statistics and preferences\n• Device information (model, OS version)\n• IP address and location data\n• Cookies and similar tracking technologies\n• Search queries and browsing history",
  "privacyTransactionTitle": "Transaction Data",
  "privacyTransactionContent": "• Purchase history and order details\n• Payment transaction information\n• Delivery and shipping information\n• Product reviews and ratings",
  "privacyUseTitle": "2. How We Use Your Information",
  "privacyUseContent": "We use your information for the following purposes:",
  "privacyUseItem1": "Process and fulfill your orders",
  "privacyUseItem2": "Provide customer support and respond to inquiries",
  "privacyUseItem3": "Send order confirmations and shipping updates",
  "privacyUseItem4": "Personalize your shopping experience",
  "privacyUseItem5": "Improve our products and services",
  "privacyUseItem6": "Send promotional offers and marketing communications",
  "privacyUseItem7": "Detect and prevent fraud and security issues",
  "privacyUseItem8": "Comply with legal obligations",
  "privacyUseItem9": "Analyze usage trends and optimize app performance",
  "privacySharingTitle": "3. Information Sharing and Disclosure",
  "privacySharingContent": "We may share your information with:",
  "privacyProvidersTitle": "Service Providers",
  "privacyProvidersContent": "Third-party vendors who assist us in operating our platform, processing payments, shipping orders, and providing customer service.",
  "privacyPartnersTitle": "Business Partners",
  "privacyPartnersContent": "Trusted partners who offer complementary services or products that may interest you.",
  "privacyLegalTitle": "Legal Requirements",
  "privacyLegalContent": "When required by law, regulation, legal process, or governmental request.",
  "privacyTransferTitle": "Business Transfers",
  "privacyTransferContent": "In connection with a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets.",
  "privacySecurityTitle": "4. Data Security",
  "privacySecurityContent": "We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal information:\n\n• Encryption of sensitive data in transit and at rest\n• Secure servers and regular security audits\n• Access controls and authentication mechanisms\n• Regular security training for our staff\n• Compliance with industry security standards",
  "privacySecurityNote": "While we strive to protect your information, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.",
  "privacyRightsTitle": "5. Your Privacy Rights",
  "privacyRightsContent": "You have the following rights regarding your personal information:",
  "privacyRightsItem1": "Access: Request a copy of your personal data",
  "privacyRightsItem2": "Correction: Update or correct inaccurate information",
  "privacyRightsItem3": "Deletion: Request deletion of your personal data",
  "privacyRightsItem4": "Opt-out: Unsubscribe from marketing communications",
  "privacyRightsItem5": "Data Portability: Receive your data in a portable format",
  "privacyRightsItem6": "Object: Object to certain data processing activities",
  "privacyRightsItem7": "Withdraw Consent: Withdraw previously given consent",
  "privacyCookiesTitle": "6. Cookies and Tracking Technologies",
  "privacyCookiesContent": "We use cookies and similar technologies to:\n\n• Remember your preferences and settings\n• Understand how you use our app\n• Provide personalized content and advertisements\n• Analyze app performance and user behavior\n\nYou can control cookies through your device settings, though some features may not function properly if disabled.",
  "privacyLinksTitle": "7. Third-Party Links",
  "privacyLinksContent": "Our app may contain links to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these third parties. We encourage you to review their privacy policies.",
  "privacyChildrenTitle": "8. Children's Privacy",
  "privacyChildrenContent": "Our service is not intended for children under 13 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has provided us with personal information, please contact us.",
  "privacyRetentionTitle": "9. Data Retention",
  "privacyRetentionContent": "We retain your personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy, unless a longer retention period is required by law.",
  "privacyInternationalTitle": "10. International Data Transfers",
  "privacyInternationalContent": "Your information may be transferred to and maintained on servers located outside your country. We ensure appropriate safeguards are in place for such transfers.",
  "privacyChangesTitle": "11. Changes to This Privacy Policy",
  "privacyChangesContent": "We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any significant changes by posting the new policy on this page and updating the \"Last Updated\" date.",
  "privacyContactTitle": "12. Contact Us",
  "privacyContactContent": "If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us:\n\nEmail: privacy@taksh-ecommerce.com\nPhone: +91 1800-123-4567\nAddress: Mumbai, Maharashtra, India",
  "privacyMattersTitle": "Your Privacy Matters",
  "privacyMattersContent": "We are committed to protecting your privacy and handling your data responsibly.",
  "ourStoryContent": "Founded in 2020, Taksh E-Commerce emerged with a vision to revolutionize online shopping in India. We started with a simple idea: to make quality products accessible to everyone, everywhere. Today, we serve millions of customers across the country, offering a diverse range of products from electronics to fashion, home essentials to groceries.",
  "ourMissionContent": "Our mission is to empower consumers by providing a seamless, trustworthy, and delightful shopping experience. We strive to connect people with products they love while supporting local businesses and promoting sustainable practices.",
  "ourVisionContent": "To become India's most customer-centric e-commerce platform, where people can discover, explore, and purchase anything they want with complete confidence and convenience.",
  "trustTransparencyDesc": "We believe in building lasting relationships through honest communication and reliable service.",
  "qualityFirstDesc": "Every product we offer meets our stringent quality standards to ensure customer satisfaction.",
  "customerCentricityDesc": "Our customers are at the heart of everything we do. Their satisfaction is our success.",
  "sustainabilityDesc": "We are committed to eco-friendly practices and reducing our environmental footprint.",
  "innovationDesc": "We continuously evolve our technology and services to provide the best shopping experience.",
  "whatWeOfferContent": "• Wide Range of Products: From electronics to fashion, home & kitchen to beauty products\n\n• Competitive Prices: Best deals and offers on quality products\n\n• Fast Delivery: Quick and reliable shipping across India\n\n• Secure Payments: Multiple payment options with top-notch security\n\n• 24/7 Support: Our customer service team is always here to help\n\n• Easy Returns: Hassle-free returns and refunds",
